ADL: BULLPEN STRUCTURE
TYPE Structural
DESCRIPTION Apps and libraries that exist in Part 1
DEFINE SYSTEM Bullpen AS bullpen
DEFINE COMPONENT Landing AS apps/landing
DEFINE COMPONENT Trading App AS apps/web
DEFINE LIBRARY UI AS packages/ui
DEFINE LIBRARY Contracts AS packages/contracts
ASSERT(every directory under apps/ and packages/ is DEFINED here)
ASSERT(every DEFINED component and library exists as a directory)
ASSERT(apps NEVER DEPEND ON other apps)
